1,History - Bunuba Country,https://www.bunuba.com/history,"Because of this law, Bunuba Country has prospered under our stewardship for more than 46,000 years. Through our ongoing practices of thangani, story, art, song, dance and ceremony, our law and knowledge has passed down across 2,000 generations of Bunuba families.",Bunuba,Australian
2,This is Our Home - Australian Music Centre,https://www.australianmusiccentre.com.au/work/stanhope-paul-this-is-our-home-ngindaji-ngarragi-muwayi,"English text by Steve Hawke, Bunuba text based on song words by June Oscar and Patsy Bedford. This is Our Home : Ngindaji ngarragî muwayi by Steve Hawke and Paul Stanhope - find sheet music, recordings, digital score and audio samples, analysis, performances and more at the Australian Music Centre.",Bunuba,Australian
